  "richtextAlert": "",
  "richtextContent": "<blockquote><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Join us in Melbourne for NASA’s Space Apps Challenge this November 14/15.</strong></b></blockquote><blockquote><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Sign up to participate now!</strong></b></blockquote><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Who can participate?</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Anyone from students, programmers, technologists and scientists to designers, entrepreneurs, and artists.</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">What are the challenges?</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> There are challenge categories spanning issues on Earth and in space. More information on the challenges can be found on the Challenges page.</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">What do I need to do?</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Register now (space is limited) find a team, pick a project and spend as much time as possible building your solution and preparing your presentation.</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Can I make my team beforehand?</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">  Yes. Form a group but register individually. We will let you know how you can meet prospective team members online.</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">How much does it cost?</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> It’s free!</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">When is it? </strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The event will run from Friday 13 November (welcome and getting ready) through to 11.59pm on Sunday 15 November.</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Where is it?</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> The event will be in-person and virtual. The location is </span><a href=\"https://www.inspire9.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external ><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Inspire9</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> in Richmond (</span><a href=\"https://www.inspire9.com/contact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-external ><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">https://www.inspire9.com/contact</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">).</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Thank you to our sponsors for 2026:</span></p><img alt=\"upload_image.22:26:52.640130\" class=\"richtext-image left\" data-format=\"left\" data-id=\"544480\" height=\"86\" src=\"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/sponsors_lsY8Zcs.width-500.jpg\" width=\"500\">",
